OL,3,GNEWSAAbseilers get to work as Civic
OL,4,ACentre revamp starts
OL,5,
OL,6,FWork on redeveloping a city centre
OL,7,Fbuilding has begun with a specialist
OL,8,Fteam of abseilers attaching giant green
OL,9,Fsafety nets around the structure.
OL,11,FThe nets, which were lifted onto the
OL,12,Froof of Plymouth's 14 storey Civic
OL,13,FCentre at the end of last week by a
OL,14,Fcrane, were being fixed to the building
OL,15,Fon Wednesday in preparation for
OL,16,Fscaffolding going up in the new year.
OL,18,FThe former council office, which has
OL,19,Fbeen redundant for years, will be
OL,20,Fturned into 144 flats and a City
OL,21,FCollege campus focusing on training in
OL,22,Fthe marine and green energy sectors.
OL,23,APub: 04-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,346,340,200,160,0,100
